{"id":"6d457d5a39e54cfe","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-club-filter.md","title":"Club Filter","display":"df-club-filter — Club Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-club-filter","aliases":["58-df-club-filter"],"display":"df-club-filter — Club Filter","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-ordinal2-closed-unbounded-filter]]","[[58-df-closed-unbounded]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-club-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-club-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-club-filter — Club Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dcaac1dfe9e1d292\" href=\"?note=dcaac1dfe9e1d292\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-closed-unbounded-filter\">58-df-zfc-ordinal2-closed-unbounded-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ccab98562a5cca1d\" href=\"?note=ccab98562a5cca1d\" title=\"58-df-closed-unbounded\">58-df-closed-unbounded</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClosedUnboundedFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClosedUnboundedFilter}_S\\)</span> (closed-unbounded-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dcaac1dfe9e1d292\" href=\"?note=dcaac1dfe9e1d292\" title=\"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-closed-unbounded-filter\">58-df-zfc-ordinal2-closed-unbounded-filter</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (closed-unbounded predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ccab98562a5cca1d\" href=\"?note=ccab98562a5cca1d\" title=\"58-df-closed-unbounded\">58-df-closed-unbounded</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (club-filter predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubFilter}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubFilter}:V\\to V\\)</span> (total family-valued operator defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}club\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClosedUnboundedFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}club\\text{-}filter} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClosedUnboundedFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}club\\text{-}filter\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClubFilter}(\\kappa)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid\\exists C\\subseteq A\\;\\mathrm{Club}_S(C,\\kappa)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}club\\text{-}filter\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClubFilter}(\\kappa)\\coloneqq\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa\\mid\\exists C\\subseteq A\\;\\mathrm{Club}_S(C,\\kappa)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}filter\\text{-}operator\\text{-}agreement} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\\to\\mathcal F_\\kappa=\\mathrm{ClubFilter}(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}filter\\text{-}operator\\text{-}agreement} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClubFilter}_S(\\mathcal F_\\kappa,\\kappa)\\to\\mathcal F_\\kappa=\\mathrm{ClubFilter}(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The operator is a genuine total set operation.  For an arbitrary <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> it returns the upward closure of the club subsets; only the predicate asserts that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is regular uncountable and that this family is a proper filter.</li>\n<li>For a regular uncountable <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClubFilter}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClubFilter}(\\kappa)\\)</span> is the proper filter generated by the closed unbounded subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-closed-unbounded-filter","status":"resolved","id":"dcaac1dfe9e1d292","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-ordinal2-closed-unbounded-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-closed-unbounded","status":"resolved","id":"ccab98562a5cca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-closed-unbounded]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-ordinal2-closed-unbounded-filter","status":"resolved","id":"dcaac1dfe9e1d292","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal2ClosedUnboundedFilter}_S$ (closed-un